    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "Boutiq Pop-Up",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "October 31, 2026\n@ 5:00 pm\n- 7:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/9b7f4c46-Boutiq-Logo.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Boutiq-Logo.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Shop the Boutiq brand at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA",
     "w": 340,
     "h": 76,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Join us for a Boutiq pop-up at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet on Saturday, October 31, 2026, from 5 to 7 p.m. Stop by our Route 6 dispensary to learn about the Boutiq brand, ask questions, and explore the Boutiq products we carry."
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Curious about the Boutiq SWITCH™? We carry the 2g TRIO V5 disposable, which lets you choose among three strains in one device. Our team can help you learn more while you’re here."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Featuring cutting-edge dual chamber technology, Boutiq SWITCH™ offers three distinct strains in a single sleek device that can be hit individually, or both at once. BOUTIQ™ Oil is a blend of pure Liquid Live Diamonds and expertly curated Terpenes.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/8aa775c6-6a966fece10f670bfdbf62e7_1522aa61e692c8cdab34f14d680017a5-236x300.webp\" alt=\"Shop Boutiq 2g TRIO Disposables at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet.\" width=\"236\" height=\"300\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6a966fece10f670bfdbf62e7_1522aa61e692c8cdab34f14d680017a5-236x300.webp?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/2f4a26e5-6a966fece10f670bfdbf62e7_1522aa61e692c8cdab34f14d680017a5.webp\"></p><p>The SWITCH™ interface allows users to seamlessly alternate between strains or blend them together, offering a personalized experience unlike anything before it. Its integrated display clearly indicates strain selection, battery life, and Blinker Count™—delivering a vaping ritual that’s interactive, refined, and uniquely personal.</p><p>The BOUTIQ SWITCH™ delivers cannabis exactly as it should be: iconic, intentional, and unmatched.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/boutiq/\"><img src=\"assets/source/d151dbdc-Shop-Now-Button-200px.png\" alt=\"Shop Now at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"200\" height=\"69\" title=\"Shop Now at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Shop-Now-Button-200px.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></a></p>"
    },
